<title>USA: Concorde Career Colleges Inc Q3 net down.</title>
<headline>Concorde Career Colleges Inc Q3 net down.</headline>
<dateline>KANSAS CITY, Mo. 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Third Quarter</p>
<p>						  1996		1995</p>
<p> Revenue			     $10,318,000	$11,101,000</p>
<p> Total operating expenses	  9,697,000	  9,881,000</p>
<p> Operating income			621,000	  1,220,000</p>
<p> Net income				862,000	    955,000</p>
<p> Earnings per share			  .11		  .12</p>
<p> Average shares outstanding	7,713,000	  7,446,000</p>
<p>						     Nine Months</p>
<p>						 1996		 1995</p>
<p> Revenue			     $30,620,000	$29,447,000</p>
<p> Total operating expenses	 28,748,000	 27,511,000</p>
<p> Operating income		    1,872,000	  1,936,000</p>
<p> Net income				985,000	  1,271,000</p>
<p> Earnings per share			  .11		  .15</p>
<p> Average shares outstanding	7,703,000	  7,406,000</p>
<p>NOTE: Earnings per share includes cumulative preferred stock dividends (not declared) of $50,000 for the three months ended Sept. 30, 1996, and $63,000 for the three months ended Sept. 30, 1995. For the nine-month period ended Sept. 30, 1996, the cumulative dividends (not declared) were $169,000 and $186,000 for the same period in 1995.</p>
<p>		 Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787</p>
